## User question:
How to disable the BGP add-paths capability for all address families on a Nokia router?
---
## Proposed answer:
To disable the BGP add-paths capability for all address families on a Nokia router, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp
no add-paths
exit
```

This command will remove Add-Paths support for all address families at the BGP instance level.
