## Proposed answer:
To configure Nokia routers to allow LLGR stale routes to be advertised to all peers, enabling them to exit the local AS, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp graceful-restart long-lived
    advertise-stale-to-all-neighbors without-no-export
exit
```

