Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To enable BGP path selection based on end-to-end IGP metrics in Nokia routers, configure the following commands:

```
configure router bgp
    best-path-selection
        deterministic-med
        always-compare-med zero
    exit
    med-out igp-cost
exit
```

These commands:
1. Enable deterministic MED comparison to ensure consistent path selection
2. Configure BGP to always compare MED values (treating missing MED as 0)
3. Set MED to use the IGP cost for path advertisements

The combination ensures BGP path selection will consider IGP metrics through the MED attribute.
