These commands:
1. Enable deterministic MED comparison to ensure consistent path selection
2. Configure BGP to always compare MED values (treating missing MED as 0)
3. Set MED to use the IGP cost for path advertisements

The combination ensures BGP path selection will consider IGP metrics through the MED attribute.
