## User question:
How to configure Nokia routers to permit BGP next-hop resolution for labeled and VPN routes using static routes (excluding default routes)?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure Nokia routers to permit BGP next-hop resolution for labeled and VPN routes using static routes (excluding default routes), use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes
    allow-static
exit
```

This configuration enables the resolution of BGP next-hops for label-IPv4, label-IPv6, VPN-IPv4, and VPN-IPv6 routes using static routes while explicitly excluding static default routes (0/0 and ::/0).
