To configure BGP authentication on your Nokia router using the encrypted key "K$12#mypass" with enhanced encryption method (hash2), use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp authentication-key "K$12#mypass" hash2
```

This command will set the BGP authentication key with enhanced encryption at the global BGP level. You can also apply this at the group or neighbor level if needed by navigating to those contexts first.
