    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables the add-paths capability for labeled-unicast IPv6 routes
2. Sets the send limit to 8 paths per prefix (adjust this number as needed)
3. Enables the ability to receive multiple paths per prefix

The add-paths feature provides fast reroute capabilities by allowing the advertisement and reception of multiple paths for the same prefix.
