To enable BGP tunneling for next-hop resolution of labeled IPv4 routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel family ipv4
                resolution-filter bgp
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This configuration enables BGP tunneling for next-hop resolution of labeled IPv4 routes by specifying BGP as the resolution filter under the transport tunnel family IPv4 context.
