To configure the BGP peer session damping parameters as requested, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    damp-peer-oscillations idle-hold-time 10 15 120 error-interval 45
exit
```

This configuration will:
- Set the initial idle-state wait time to 10 minutes
- Set the second wait time to 15 minutes 
- Set the maximum wait time to 120 minutes
- Require a 45-minute error-free interval to reset the penalty counter
