## Proposed answer:
To prevent Nokia routers from reflecting BGP routes back to clients within a specific group, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        disable-client-reflect
    exit
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with the name of your BGP group where you want to disable route reflection to clients. This command will stop the route reflector from sending reflected routes to clients in the specified group.
