To configure a Nokia router to accept a maximum of 500 dynamic BGP sessions from remote peers within a BGP instance, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    dynamic-neighbor-limit 500
exit
```

This sets the global limit for dynamic BGP sessions to 500 for the entire BGP instance.
