To configure a Nokia router's BGP session to advertise capability for receiving VPN IPv4 routes with next-hop AFI=2, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv4
exit
```

This command enables the extended next-hop encoding capability specifically for VPN-IPv4 routes, allowing the router to advertise its ability to receive these routes with next-hop AFI=2 during BGP session establishment.
