Here are the CLI configuration commands to configure a Nokia router to report both IPv6 unicast (labeled) and IPv4 VPN (SAFI 128) address families to a BMP monitoring station:

```cli
configure
    bmp
        station "BMP_STATION_NAME" create
            family label-ipv6 vpn-ipv4
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `"BMP_STATION_NAME"` with your desired BMP monitoring station name. This configuration:
- Enables BMP monitoring
- Creates a BMP station
- Configures the station to report:
  - Labeled IPv6 unicast routes (`label-ipv6`)
  - IPv4 VPN routes with SAFI 128 (`vpn-ipv4`)
