To enter the context for enabling or disabling flowspec validations in Nokia router's BGP configuration, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
flowspec
```

Once in the `flowspec` context, you can enable or disable specific validations such as:

```
validate-dest-prefix
no validate-dest-prefix
```

or 

```
validate-redirect-ip
no validate-redirect-ip
```
