Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To enable BGP Graceful Restart helper functionality on a Nokia router to assist neighboring routers during their restart process, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
    stale-routes-time 3600
    restart-time 300
exit
```

For more granular control at the group or neighbor level, you can also configure:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    graceful-restart
    stale-routes-time 3600
    restart-time 300
exit
```

Or for a specific neighbor:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    graceful-restart
    stale-routes-time 3600
    restart-time 300
exit
```
