## Proposed answer:
To enable BGP Graceful Restart helper functionality on a Nokia router to assist neighboring routers during their restart process, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
    stale-routes-time 3600
    restart-time 300
exit
```

For more granular control at the group or neighbor level, you can also configure:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    graceful-restart
    stale-routes-time 3600
    restart-time 300
exit
```

Or for a specific neighbor:

```
