To enable BGP graceful restart helper functionality for IPv6 routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
    exit
```

This will enable BGP graceful restart helper procedures globally, which includes support for IPv6 routes. The router will now act as a helper during BGP graceful restart events for IPv6 routes when the peer also supports this capability.
