To configure a Nokia router to impose a local LLGR stale time of 3600 seconds while overriding the peer-advertised value, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp graceful-restart long-lived
    helper-override-stale-time 3600
exit
```

This configuration will set the locally imposed LLGR stale time to 3600 seconds for all address families, overriding any values advertised by peers.
