To enable BGP load balancing for multiple paths with identical IGP metrics on a Nokia router, use the following configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 8
    ibgp-multipath
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables BGP multipath with a maximum of 8 parallel paths (`multipath 8`)
2. Specifically enables IBGP multipath load balancing (`ibgp-multipath`)

The `multipath` command enables ECMP forwarding for both EBGP and IBGP routes (with the specified maximum paths), while `ibgp-multipath` ensures proper load balancing for IBGP routes when multiple nexthops are available.
