    multipath ibgp 8
    ibgp-multipath
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables IBGP multipath with a maximum of 8 equal-cost paths (`multipath ibgp 8`)
2. Activates IBGP multipath load balancing (`ibgp-multipath`)

The value `8` can be adjusted based on your requirements (valid range is 1-64). These commands will allow the router to load balance traffic across multiple IBGP paths with equal cost.
