To configure the Nokia router BGP to apply an inbound route policy named "NYC_Filter" with a secondary policy expression "AND Chicago_Prefix", use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    import "NYC_Filter AND Chicago_Prefix"
exit
```

This will apply both the "NYC_Filter" policy and the "Chicago_Prefix" policy as an AND expression to all inbound BGP routes. The policies must be previously defined in the `config>router>policy-options` context.
