To configure a Nokia router to apply the route policy "cust123-inbound-filter" for incoming routes from a specific BGP peer, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    group <peer-group-name>
        neighbor <peer-IP-address>
            import "cust123-inbound-filter"
```

Replace `<peer-group-name>` with the BGP peer group name and `<peer-IP-address>` with the IP address of the specific peer. This will apply the "cust123-inbound-filter" policy to all incoming routes from that peer.
------------
