To configure a custom welcome message "BMP Station Alert: Contact Support at +1-555-123-4567" upon connection establishment on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
bmp
station "BMP_Station" create
connection
description "BMP Station Alert: Contact Support at +1-555-123-4567"
exit
exit
```

Note: The `description` command under the `connection` context is typically used to set a text description/message for the connection. If your specific Nokia platform requires a different command for banner/welcome messages, you may need to consult additional documentation.
