```
configure
bmp
station "BMP_STATION_NAME"
description "Maintenance Contact: support@example.com, Phone: +1-555-1234567"
exit all
```

Replace `BMP_STATION_NAME` with your actual BMP station name. This will display the specified maintenance contact information when a connection is established with the BMP monitoring station.
