Here are the CLI configuration commands to configure your Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per unlabeled IPv6 unicast prefix while disabling the receive capability:

```
configure router bgp
    multipath 8
    add-paths
        ipv6 send 8 receive none
    exit
exit
