To configure your Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per unlabeled IPv6 unicast prefix and negotiate to receive multiple routes per prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        ipv6 send 8 receive
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables add-paths for unlabeled IPv6 unicast routes
2. Sets the maximum advertised paths to 8 per prefix (`send 8`)
3. Negotiates the ability to receive multiple routes per prefix (`receive`)
