To configure the Nokia router to declare a TCP connection down after missing 15 consecutive keepalives, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station "station-name"
            connection
                tcp-keepalive
                    keep-count 15
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `"station-name"` with the actual BMP station name in your configuration. This sets the number of missed keepalives to 15 before declaring the TCP connection down.
