To configure the BGP keepalive timer to 60 seconds on a Nokia router, use the following command:

```
configure router bgp keepalive 60
```

This command sets the BGP keepalive interval to 60 seconds globally for all BGP sessions under the BGP instance. You can also apply it at the group or neighbor level if needed.
