To enable LDP tunneling for next-hop resolution of BGP labeled routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes transport-tunnel family ipv4 resolution-filter ldp
```

If you also want to enforce strict tunnel tagging for LDP LSPs:
```
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution labeled-routes transport-tunnel family ipv4 enforce-strict-tunnel-tagging
```

For IPv6 routes, replace `ipv4` with `ipv6` in both commands.
