Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To enable LDP tunneling for next-hop resolution of /32 IPv4 FECs in BGP labeled routes, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family ipv4
                    resolution-filter ldp
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

If you also want to enforce strict tunnel tagging for these LDP tunnels, add:
```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family ipv4
                    enforce-strict-tunnel-tagging
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```
