To enable BGP Long-Lived Graceful-Restart functionality on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp graceful-restart
    long-lived
    stale-routes-time <time>
    restart-time <seconds>
exit
```

Replace `<time>` with the desired stale routes maintenance time (1-3600 seconds) and `<seconds>` with the restart-time value (0-4095 seconds). 

For example:
```
configure router bgp graceful-restart
    long-lived
    stale-routes-time 1800
    restart-time 240
exit
```
