To enable BGP Long-Lived Graceful-Restart procedures on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp graceful-restart
    long-lived
exit
```

This will enable LLGR at the global BGP level. You can also apply it at the group or neighbor level if needed:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> graceful-restart
    long-lived
exit
```

or

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address> graceful-restart
    long-lived
exit
```
