To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per multicast IPv6 VPN prefix and disable receiving multiple routes for this prefix, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    add-paths
        mcast-vpn-ipv6 send 8 receive none
    exit
exit
```

