## User question:
How to enter the context for configuring monitor parameters on a Nokia router in BGP configuration mode?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure monitor parameters in BGP configuration mode on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    monitor
```

This enters the monitor context under BGP configuration where you can configure specific monitoring parameters. From here, you can also navigate to group or neighbor level monitoring contexts if needed:

```
configure router bgp group <group-name>
    monitor
```

or

```
configure router bgp group <group-name> neighbor <ip-address>
    monitor
---
