```
configure router bgp
    group <group-name>
        neighbor <peer-ip-address>
            multihop 128
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP group name and `<peer-ip-address>` with the IP address of your EBGP peer. This will set the TTL value to 128 for all packets sent to this EBGP peer.
