- Sets the maximum multipaths per prefix to 8 (`max-paths 8`)
- Allows up to 12 paths for EBGP routes (`ebgp 12`)
- Restricts non-best paths to those with the same neighbor AS as the best path (`restrict same-neighbor-as`)
