```

Replace `<primary-ip>` with your route reflector's primary IP address and `<cluster-id>` with your desired cluster ID (e.g., 1.1.1.1). 

For each client group or neighbor that should participate in ORR, ensure they are configured as route reflector clients within the same cluster. Example:

```bash
