To configure the autonomous system number for a BGP remote peer with value 65001 on a Nokia router, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
group <group-name>
    peer-as 65001
exit
```

or at the neighbor level:

```
configure router bgp
group <group-name>
    neighbor <ip-address>
        peer-as 65001
    exit
exit
```

Replace `<group-name>` with your BGP group name and `<ip-address>` with the neighbor's IP address if configuring at the neighbor level.
