To configure Nokia routers to automatically remove stale BGP VPN-IP routes after 15 minutes if they are not refreshed, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    purge-timer 15
exit
```

This sets the purge timer to 15 minutes (900 seconds), which will automatically remove stale VPN-IP routes if they are not refreshed within this timeframe.
