## User question:
How to disable the delay in sending BGP withdrawals on a Nokia router?
---
## Proposed answer:
To disable the delay in sending BGP withdrawals on a Nokia router, use the following CLI command:

```
configure router bgp disable-fast-external-failover
```

This will immediately send BGP withdrawal messages without waiting for the hold timer to expire.
---
