To enable reporting of local routes to the BMP monitoring station on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station <station-name> create
            report-local-routes
            family [ipv4] [ipv6] [label-ipv4] [label-ipv6] [vpn-ipv4] [vpn-ipv6]
            connection
                station-address {<ip-address> | <ipv6-address>} port <port>
                local-address {<ip-address> | <ipv6-address>}
                router <router-instance>
                connect-retry <seconds>
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

Replace `<station-name>`, `<ip-address>`/`<ipv6-address>`, `<port>`, `<router-instance>`, and `<seconds>` with your specific values. The `family` command should include the address families you want to monitor.
