Here are the CLI configuration commands to configure Nokia routers to allow only RSVP-TE and Segment Routing tunnels programmed by IS-IS for resolving BGP unlabeled routes:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunnels
            family ipv4
                resolution-filter rsvp sr-isis
            exit
            family ipv6
                resolution-filter rsvp sr-isis
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
