To configure BGP label route resolution to bind only to the subset of tunnel types specified under resolution-filter, use these CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family
                    resolution filter
                    resolution-filter
                        bgp
                        ldp
                        rsvp
                        # Add other desired tunnel types here
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace `bgp`, `ldp`, and `rsvp` with the specific tunnel types you want to include in your resolution filter. This configuration ensures BGP label routes will only resolve using the explicitly enabled tunnel types.
