To configure BGP next-hop resolution to only bind to specific tunnel types in the resolution-filter, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunn family ipv4
            resolution-filter [ldp] [rsvp] [sr-isis] [sr-ospf] [sr-policy] [sr-te]
        exit
        shortcut-tunn family ipv6
            resolution-filter [ldp] [rsvp] [sr-isis] [sr-ospf] [sr-policy] [sr-te]
        exit
    exit
exit
```

Replace the tunnel types inside the square brackets with your desired tunnel types (e.g., `ldp`, `rsvp`, etc.). The example shows both IPv4 and IPv6 families - configure only the relevant ones for your needs.
