To configure a Nokia router to import active IPv4 routes from the IP route table into BGP RIB using a policy named "customer-routes", use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        rib-management
            ipv4
                route-table-import "customer-routes"
```

This configuration will apply the specified policy to control which active IPv4 routes are imported from the IP route table into the BGP RIB.
