To configure a Nokia router to use the VPRN service named 'customer-backbone' for connecting to the BMP monitoring station, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station <station-name> create
            connection
                router service-name customer-backbone
                station-address <ip-address> port <port>
            exit
