To enable the context for configuring tunnel types to resolve unlabeled IPv4/IPv6 BGP routes under next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution shortcut-tunnel family ipv4
configure router bgp next-hop-resolution shortcut-tunnel family ipv6
```

These commands create the context to configure tunnel types for resolving unlabeled IPv4 and IPv6 BGP routes respectively. You can then specify specific tunnel types (e.g., BGP, UDP) within each family context as needed.
