To configure Nokia routers for enabling resolution of unlabeled IPv4 BGP routes using tunnel types under BGP next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunnel
            family ipv4
                resolution-filter
                    bgp
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
        use-bgp-routes
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enters the BGP next-hop resolution context
2. Configures shortcut tunnels for IPv4 family
3. Enables BGP tunneling for next-hop resolution
4. Allows recursive resolution of BGP next-hops using BGP routes

The `use-bgp-routes` command enables recursive resolution of unlabeled IPv4 BGP routes through up to four levels of BGP route recursion.
