To configure Nokia routers for enabling resolution of unlabeled IPv4 BGP routes using tunnel types under BGP next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunnel
            family ipv4
                resolution-filter
