Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To configure Nokia routers to use Segment Routing tunnels from the lowest preference OSPF instance for BGP next-hop resolution, use the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunnel
            family ipv4
                resolution-filter sr-ospf3
            exit
            family ipv6
                resolution-filter sr-ospf3
            exit
        exit
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family ipv4
                    resolution-filter sr-ospf3
                exit
                family ipv6
                    resolution-filter sr-ospf3
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

These commands enable SR-OSPF3 tunnel selection for both IPv4 and IPv6 BGP next-hop resolution, prioritizing the lowest preference OSPF instance.
