## User question:
How to enable Segment Routing tunnel selection by TE instances for BGP next-hop resolution on a Nokia router?
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable Segment Routing tunnel selection by TE instances for BGP next-hop resolution on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunn family ipv4
            resolution-filter sr-te
```

For labeled routes, you can also configure:
```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes transport-tunnel family ipv4
            resolution-filter sr-te
```

These commands will configure BGP to use SR-TE tunnels for next-hop resolution of both unlabeled and labeled BGP routes.
