To enable Segment Routing TE tunnel selection for BGP next-hop resolution on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunn family ipv4 resolution-filter
            sr-isis
            sr-policy
        exit
        labeled-routes transport-tunnel family ipv4 resolution-filter
            sr-isis
            sr-policy
        exit
    exit
exit
```

These commands configure BGP to use both IS-IS Segment Routing tunnels and Segment Routing policies for next-hop resolution of IPv4 routes in both shortcut tunneling and labeled route scenarios.
