To configure TCP keepalive parameters for a station on Nokia routers, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure
    bmp
        station
            connection
                tcp-keepalive
                    keep-interval <interval>
                    keep-count <count>
                    keep-idle <idle>
```

Replace `<interval>`, `<count>`, and `<idle>` with your desired values:
- `keep-interval`: Time between probes (1-100000 seconds)
- `keep-count`: Missed probes before declaring down (3-100)
- `keep-idle`: Time until first probe (1-100000 seconds)

Example with default values:
```
configure
    bmp
        station
            connection
                tcp-keepalive
                    keep-interval 15
                    keep-count 4
                    keep-idle 600
```
