Generate CLI configuration commands that fulfill the user's request using the information from the reference content. Please respond directly to the user's question. Do not mention phrases like "based on the information you provided", "according to the documentation", or anything similar.
To enable UDP tunnel selection for BGP next-hop resolution of labeled routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family
                        resolution-filter
                            udp
```

This configuration will select UDP tunnels in the Tunnel Table Manager (TTM) for next-hop resolution of labeled routes.
