## Proposed answer:
To enable UDP tunnel selection for BGP next-hop resolution of labeled routes on a Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            labeled-routes
                transport-tunnel
                    family
                        resolution-filter
                            udp
```

This configuration will select UDP tunnels in the Tunnel Table Manager (TTM) for next-hop resolution of labeled routes.
