## User question:
How to enable non-disruptive handling of BGP UPDATE message errors on a Nokia router when no length errors prevent NLRI field parsing?
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable non-disruptive handling of BGP UPDATE message errors on your Nokia router, use the following CLI configuration:

```
configure router bgp error-handling
    update-fault-tolerance
exit
```

This command activates the `treat-as-withdraw` behavior for handling UPDATE message errors while ensuring NLRI fields can still be parsed correctly.
