To configure Nokia routers to handle BGP UPDATE message errors in a non-disruptive manner when no length errors prevent NLRI field parsing, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp error-handling
    update-fault-tolerance
exit
```

This enables the `treat-as-withdraw` behavior for UPDATE message errors while ensuring NLRI fields can still be parsed correctly.
------------
