To configure a Nokia router for recursive resolution of BGP next-hops for unlabeled IPv4/IPv6 routes using BGP routes, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunnel
            family ipv4
            exit
            family ipv6
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

This configuration enables next-hop resolution for both unlabeled IPv4 and IPv6 BGP routes by allowing them to resolve through tunnels in the tunnel table. The `shortcut-tunnel` context under `next-hop-resolution` is specifically designed for this purpose.
------------
