To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 VPN-IPv6 paths per NLRI while disabling the receive capability, use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    family vpn-ipv6
    exit
    add-paths
        ipv6 send 8 receive none
    exit
exit
```

This configuration:
1. Enables the VPN-IPv6 address family under BGP
2. Configures add-paths to send up to 8 VPN-IPv6 paths per NLRI (`send 8`)
3. Disables the ability to receive multiple paths for the same prefix (`receive none`)
